      "reply_to_account_id": null,
      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Sustained impact through Operation Pacific Viper. \n\n@USCG Cutter Escanaba and its embarked helicopter team located and recovered a floating bale field Sunday in the Eastern Pacific, seizing over 4,500 lbs of cocaine valued at nearly $34M. That’s 1.7M potentially lethal doses that will never reach our communities. \n\nThrough Operation Pacific Viper, the Coast Guard has seized 215K+ pounds of cocaine and apprehended 160 suspected narco-terrorists. Alongside our partners and allies, we’re scouring the Eastern Pacific, disrupting criminal networks, and keeping America safe. \n\nBravo Zulu, CGC Escanaba! \n\nRead more here: https://t.co/LIugIaySpe",
      "text_resolved": "Sustained impact through Operation Pacific Viper. \n\n@USCG Cutter Escanaba and its embarked helicopter team located and recovered a floating bale field Sunday in the Eastern Pacific, seizing over 4,500 lbs of cocaine valued at nearly $34M. That’s 1.7M potentially lethal doses that will never reach our communities. \n\nThrough Operation Pacific Viper, the Coast Guard has seized 215K+ pounds of cocaine and apprehended 160 suspected narco-terrorists. Alongside our partners and allies, we’re scouring the Eastern Pacific, disrupting criminal networks, and keeping America safe. \n\nBravo Zulu, CGC Escanaba! \n\nRead more here: https://bit.ly/4eaH1zp",
