      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Five lives saved. \n\nOn April 2, @USCG Cutter Waesche, MH-60 Jayhawk, and HC-130 Hercules aircrews rescued five people from fishing vessel Ocean Bay after it grounded and took on water near Umnak Island.  \n\nA Good Samaritan vessel arrived first on scene and relayed vital communications before our crews arrived and safely hoisted all five mariners from the vessel. \n\nThis is integrated search and rescue in action. On the worst of days, in the harshest environments, we're Always Ready. \n\nRead more: https://t.co/P5rhy5CRxf",
      "text_resolved": "Five lives saved. \n\nOn April 2, @USCG Cutter Waesche, MH-60 Jayhawk, and HC-130 Hercules aircrews rescued five people from fishing vessel Ocean Bay after it grounded and took on water near Umnak Island.  \n\nA Good Samaritan vessel arrived first on scene and relayed vital communications before our crews arrived and safely hoisted all five mariners from the vessel. \n\nThis is integrated search and rescue in action. On the worst of days, in the harshest environments, we're Always Ready. \n\nRead more: https://bit.ly/48okN9q",
